  - New: it now ASSIGNS `TORCH_BLAS_PREFER_HIPBLASLT=1` and `HIPBLASLT_TENSILE_LIBPATH=/home/lihuzhan/.local/hipblaslt-gfx1250/gfx1250`, and adds an `env_line()` helper.
