## 4. Measurements

Every row is the baseline measured through the runner, with the card exclusive (no other KFD holders). There are no speed columns, because steps 7–9 were not run. Run dirs: `op/.runs/ut_baseline_edges`, `op/.runs/ut_baseline_spec`.

