- The 200-run bitwise determinism gate has never been run.
- Whether 50 dB is the right bar for fp32 `lse` is open. Op Setup must report the baseline lse SQNR.
- The import proof (O_VARIANT v3→v1→v3 moves the number, confirmed by descriptor) is not done yet.
- The ASM target's first-call JIT build time has not been measured.
- The `min_gain` 0.007 noise floor has not been re-measured on today's boot.


